mode: "100644"
text: "# Plan, promote, run, repurpose + two worked examples\n\n## Platform pick (verify-quarterly)\n| Platform | Best for | Threshold / note |\n|---|---|---|\n| YouTube Live | evergreen discovery, replay, search, large events | mobile-live ~50+ subs |\n| TikTok LIVE | vertical discovery, community, TikTok Shop live shopping | ~1,000 followers; unlimited length |\n| Instagram Live | creator community, Q&A (sell via keyword-to-DM; native live shopping gone) | public + ~1,000 followers; schedule 1hr–90d |\n| LinkedIn Live | B2B, webinars, thought leadership | via approved tools |\n| X | realtime viral, reposts | X Premium + public profile |\n\n## Run-of-show template\n```\n00:00 Hook (2-min tip/topic) + pin a comment with the topic (for late joiners)\n02:00 Content: answer 5-7 pre-submitted Qs (collected via a Stories Q&A sticker)\n       Engagement: greet joiners by name; recap for late joiners every few minutes\n(opt) Live selling: feature product; pin products where native (TikTok Shop/YouTube) or pin a comment +\n      keyword-to-DM (IG); flash discount valid during the live only\n~end  CTA: keyword-to-DM (\"comment LINK for the resource/offer\") + where to go next\n```\n\n## Pre-live promo cadence (scheduled via WoopSocial)\n```\nT-1 week: announce + schedule the Live (followers can set a reminder)\nT-2 days: teaser / \"here's what we'll cover\" + collect Qs (Q&A sticker)\nT-1 day:  countdown + guest reveal\nT-1 hour: \"going live soon\" reminder\n(go-live itself is native -- the human hits Live in-app)\n```\n\n## Live engagement playbook (human / native)\n```\nGreet people by name as they join | read + answer comments aloud | recap the topic for late joiners |\nkeep energy up | feature products + pin CTAs (shopping) | drop the keyword-to-DM trigger | thank + CTA to close.\n```\n\n## Repurposing pipeline (scheduled via WoopSocial)\n```\nrecording -> 3-6 short clips (captions-and-clipping) -> scheduled across platforms (cross-platform-repurposing)\n          -> on-demand replay + a recap post + quote cards (content-recycling)  => one live = a multi-phase campaign\n```\n\n## WoopSocial flow\n```\nagent plans the live + run-of-show -> schedules the promo posts (WoopSocial) -> human runs the live NATIVELY\n-> agent plans the repurpose -> clips scheduled + published (WoopSocial). WoopSocial does NOT broadcast the live,\ndo realtime comments/moderation, or run live shopping. Never fabricate viewer numbers.\n```\n\n## Worked example 1 - product brand, selling on IG Live via keyword-to-DM (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nGoal: sell the new drop. IG Live (we're public + over 1k). Run-of-show: 2-min hook, demo 3 products, flash code valid during\nthe live. IG has no native live product tags anymore, so the sell is \"comment DROP for the link\" (keyword-to-DM) + a pinned\ncomment. Promo: I schedule announce/teaser/countdown/reminder in WoopSocial. I go live in-app, greet by name, drop the keyword.\nAfter: I cut 4 clips (captions-and-clipping), schedule them + a replay. WoopSocial never \"runs\" the live -- I do.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 - B2B founder, LinkedIn Live (warm studio voice)\n```\nA monthly LinkedIn Live AMA. We collect questions in advance, prep a loose run-of-show, and schedule the promo + reminder through\nWoopSocial. The founder hosts it live -- greeting people, answering by name, recapping for late joiners. Afterward we turn the\nrecording into a few short clips and a recap post, scheduled out over the next two weeks -- one conversation, a fortnight of content. No invented view counts.\n```\n\nBoth: platform/goal scoped; run-of-show + tech ready; promo scheduled via WoopSocial; the live run natively by a human\n(engagement + shopping native); the recording repurposed into scheduled clips; viewer numbers never fabricated.\n"
